            <description>
                <p>Release description</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fix major issue with titlebars and themes on all Linux platforms</li>
                    <li>Typographical fixes</li>
                    <li>Formatting (red-letter) fixes</li>
                    <li>Add Inno Setup installer for Windows builds</li>
                    <li>Updated Flutter and dependency versions</li>
